-- Reads only: nothing is written, so the repeated query is a miss as well
QueryCacheOnDiskMisses
-- Neither reads nor writes: the query cache on disk is not consulted at all
-- Written with codec LZ4
QueryCacheOnDiskMisses
QueryCacheOnDiskWrittenBytes
-- Read with a different codec setting: the compression frames are self-describing
QueryCacheOnDiskHits
QueryCacheOnDiskReadBytes
-- Reads only: the entry is served, and the codec setting is not validated because it is not needed
QueryCacheOnDiskHits
QueryCacheOnDiskReadBytes
-- An invalid codec fails the query when writes are enabled
UNKNOWN_CODEC
-- The codec setting takes effect: the same result is bigger uncompressed than compressed
ok
